# Adaptive Cookbook — design contract

Before writing or changing UI, read [DESIGN.md](../../DESIGN.md). It is authoritative and overrides shadcn, Tailwind UI, and any “clean modern SaaS” default.

Non-negotiables:

- Fraunces (display, WONK off except wordmark) + Source Sans 3 (body). Never Inter.
- Terracotta-on-cream OKLCH tokens from `app/globals.css`. Never indigo/violet/purple. Never blue gradients.
- Light mode default. Dark is optional warm espresso, not gray.
- `--radius: 0.625rem`. No `rounded-2xl` everywhere. Pills only for chips.
- No arbitrary Tailwind brackets. No hex in components.
- Editorial layout: left-aligned hero, whitespace over card-grids, unequal emphasis.
- Lucide only. No emoji icons.
- Skeletons, never spinners. Motion 120 / 200 / 280ms with the documented easings.
- Cook Mode: large type, inline quantities in steps, multiple timers, 44px targets.

If a generated screen drifts (Inter, purple, centered badge hero, accent-stripe cards, glass, identical icon-top trios), stop and correct it against DESIGN.md before adding more screens.
